*> vybe-test: cobol/pic_clauses/test_pic_edited_signs
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_pic_clauses.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-SRC PIC S9(5) VALUE -42.
01 WS-EDIT-PLUS PIC +9(5) VALUE ZERO.
01 WS-EDIT-MINUS PIC -9(5) VALUE ZERO.
01 WS-EDIT-TRAILING PIC 9(5)- VALUE ZERO.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    MOVE WS-SRC TO WS-EDIT-PLUS.
    DISPLAY WS-EDIT-PLUS.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING WS-EDIT-PLUS DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "-00042"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [-00042] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    MOVE WS-SRC TO WS-EDIT-MINUS.
    DISPLAY WS-EDIT-MINUS.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING WS-EDIT-MINUS DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "-00042"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [-00042] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    MOVE WS-SRC TO WS-EDIT-TRAILING.
    DISPLAY WS-EDIT-TRAILING.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING WS-EDIT-TRAILING DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "00042-"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [00042-] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

